const ARTS=[
{id:'a1',cat:'Artificial Intelligence',lvl:'Beginner',min:3,t:'What is AI, in plain words?',b:['Artificial intelligence is software that performs tasks we usually associate with human thinking, such as recognizing speech, translating language, or suggesting what to watch next.','Most AI you meet today learns patterns from large amounts of example data instead of following hand-written rules for every case.','Example: a spam filter is shown many emails labeled spam or not spam, and learns which patterns separate them.'],adv:'Advanced note: “AI” is an umbrella term. Machine learning is one approach inside it, and deep learning is a subset of machine learning that uses multi-layer neural networks.'},
{id:'a2',cat:'Generative AI',lvl:'Beginner',min:4,t:'How language models answer you',b:['A large language model is trained on a huge amount of text to predict what text is likely to come next. By repeating that step, it can write whole answers.','It does not look facts up like a search engine by default, and it can state wrong things confidently. Always check important claims against a trusted source.','Example: ask it to explain a topic, then ask it to list what you should verify independently.'],adv:'Advanced note: text is split into tokens, and the model has a limited context window, which caps how much of your conversation it can consider at once.'},
{id:'a3',cat:'Prompt Engineering',lvl:'Beginner',min:3,t:'Writing a prompt that works',b:['Good prompts state who the AI should act as, what to do, the relevant background, and what shape the answer should take.','Be specific about audience and length. “Explain this to a 12-year-old in 100 words” beats “explain this”.','If the first answer misses, reply with what to change instead of starting over.'],adv:'Advanced note: giving one or two worked examples inside the prompt (few-shot prompting) often steers format and style more reliably than description alone.'},
{id:'a4',cat:'Cybersecurity',lvl:'Beginner',min:3,t:'Using AI tools safely',b:['Do not paste passwords, private customer data, or confidential company documents into any tool unless you know its data policy and are allowed to.','Read each tool’s privacy settings. Many let you opt out of having your chats used for training.','Treat AI-written code and links as untrusted until you have reviewed them.'],adv:'Advanced note: prompt injection is when text inside a document or web page tries to give hidden instructions to an AI that reads it. Limit what actions an AI agent can take on its own.'},
{id:'a5',cat:'Business Automation',lvl:'Advanced',min:4,t:'Finding tasks worth automating',b:['Good candidates are repetitive, rule-based, and low-risk: sorting email, drafting routine replies, moving data between apps.','Start with one task, measure how long it takes by hand, and keep a human reviewing results before you scale up.','Example: draft support replies with AI, but have a person approve before sending.'],adv:'Advanced note: define what “correct” means before automating, and log inputs and outputs so errors can be traced.'}];
